{"title":"호감도 올리려다 광공들을 꼬셔버렸다 [19세 완전판]","thumbnail":null,"synopsis":"로또 1등에 당첨되었다.기쁘게 집에 돌아오다가 차에 치여서 게임 속에 빙의했다.캐릭터 호감도를 만땅으로 올려야다시 원래 세계로 돌아갈 수 있다고 했다.할 수 없이 게임 캐릭터들을 후리며 호감도를 올렸더니,미친놈들이 꼬인다 “정말이지…… 가둬 놓고 싶군.”“네놈 말에 동의하고 싶지는 않지만, 동감이야.”“족쇄부터 준비할까요?”“좋습니다.”하여간 이 개자식들. 이런 식으로 나온다 이거지?그렇다면 할 수 없지.“저 원래 감금 좋게 생각했어요. 내 인생의 꿈! 바로 여러분께 감금당하기! 지금 당장 감금당하면 될까요?”","topComments":[],"commentKeywords":[],"rankSeries":{"daily":[{"date":"2026-08-10","rank":213,"change":{"type":"new","amount":null}},{"date":"2026-08-11","rank":129,"change":{"type":"up","amount":84}},{"date":"2026-08-13","rank":192,"change":{"type":"new","amount":null}},{"date":"2026-08-14","rank":116,"change":{"type":"up","amount":76}},{"date":"2026-08-15","rank":81,"change":{"type":"up","amount":35}},{"date":"2026-08-16","rank":56,"change":{"type":"up","amount":25}},{"date":"2026-08-17","rank":67,"change":{"type":"down","amount":11}},{"date":"2026-08-18","rank":77,"change":{"type":"down","amount":10}},{"date":"2026-08-19","rank":102,"change":{"type":"down","amount":25}},{"date":"2026-08-20","rank":96,"change":{"type":"up","amount":6}},{"date":"2026-08-21","rank":65,"change":{"type":"up","amount":31}},{"date":"2026-08-23","rank":197,"change":{"type":"new","amount":null}},{"date":"2026-08-25","rank":211,"change":{"type":"new","amount":null}},{"date":"2026-08-26","rank":144,"change":{"type":"up","amount":67}},{"date":"2026-08-27","rank":108,"change":null},{"date":"2026-08-28","rank":271,"change":{"type":"down","amount":163}},{"date":"2026-08-29","rank":116,"change":{"type":"up","amount":155}},{"date":"2026-08-30","rank":117,"change":{"type":"down","amount":1}},{"date":"2026-08-31","rank":98,"change":{"type":"up","amount":19}},{"date":"2026-09-01","rank":98,"change":{"type":"same","amount":null}},{"date":"2026-09-02","rank":273,"change":{"type":"down","amount":175}},{"date":"2026-09-06","rank":143,"change":{"type":"new","amount":null}},{"date":"2026-09-09","rank":220,"change":{"type":"new","amount":null}},{"date":"